==Icelandic==

===Adjective===
{{is-adj}}
# [[complete]]d, [[finish]]ed, [[over]]
#: ''Ertu '''búinn''' að fara út með ruslið?''
#:: Did you take out the trash?
#: ''Er myndin '''búin'''?''
#:: Is the film '''over'''?
# [[deplete]]d, [[finish]]ed
#: ''Því miður, kaffið er '''búið'''.''
#:: I'm afraid we don't have any more coffee.
# [[exhausted]]
# [[fit out|fitted out]], [[fit up|fitted up]], [[ready]]{{jump|is|fitted out|s}}
#: ''Hersveitin var vel vopnum '''búin'''.''
#:: The squadron was '''heavily''' armed.
#: ''Hún er vel '''búin'''.''
#:: She's warmly '''dressed'''.

====Derived terms====
* [[að svo búnu]] (after that, with that being done)
* [[búinn að vera]] (to be finished, to be over)
* [[búinn við|búinn við einhverju]] (to be prepared for something)
* [[illa í stakk búinn til|illa í stakk búinn til einhvers]] (to be badly prepared to do something)
* [[vel í stakk búinn til|vel í stakk búinn til einhvers]] (to be well prepared to do something)

====Related terms====
* [[tilbúinn]]
* [[undirbúinn]]

